<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">STOCK / READY FOR THE FLOOR</view><view class="title">库存与备货</view><view class="subtitle">实物、占用与可售量，一眼清楚。</view>
  <view class="actions"><button class="primary compact" data-type="receive" bindtap="action">＋ 收货</button><button class="ghost compact" data-type="transfer" bindtap="action">调拨</button><button class="ghost compact" data-type="adjust" bindtap="action">盘点更正</button></view>
  <view class="notice">全员共享库存记录；调拨须经在途发货和接收核对。</view><input class="search" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索已加载商品、SKU 或库位"/><view class="muted small">已加载 {{items.length}} / {{total}} 条 · 搜索仅限已加载记录</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="ghost compact gap" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="key" class="card gap"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="record-title">{{item.product_name}}</view><view class="record-sub">{{item.sku}} · {{item.location_name}}</view></view><text class="badge">可售 {{item.available}}</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row small"><text class="muted">在手 {{item.on_hand}}</text><text class="muted">已占用 {{item.reserved}}</text><text class="strong">可售 {{item.available}}</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在同步库存…</view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !visible.length}}" class="empty">暂无匹配库存。新到商品收货后会出现在这里。</view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="ghost gap" bindtap="more" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多库存</button><view class="hint gap">可售量 = 在手 − 待收款占用。销售准备时仍需进行服务端库存校验。</view>
</view>
